<BaseLayout title="Our Story | David Dindi" description="Discover the ideas behind David Dindi: authenticity, craftsmanship, heritage and considered leather goods.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Our story</div><span class="eyebrow">The thinking behind the work</span><h1>Character, craft and things worth keeping.</h1><p class="lead">David Dindi is built around considered design, honest materials and useful objects made to become part of everyday life.</p></div></section>
  <section class="container content">
    <h2>Own it. For a Lifetime.</h2>
    <p>Our tagline expresses an ambition: create pieces that feel personal, serve a purpose and invite long-term use. Product details and care matter as much as appearance.</p>
    <h2>One parent brand, two paths</h2>
    <p><strong>David Dindi</strong> presents consumer leather goods and accessories. <strong>David Dindi Manufacturing</strong> serves brands and businesses looking to discuss custom manufacturing and production projects. The divisions share a foundation in craft while speaking to different customer needs.</p>
    <h2>Materials with character</h2>
    <p>Natural leather is not a perfectly uniform surface. Grain, tone and visible marks can differ. We aim to explain those characteristics clearly so customers can make informed decisions.</p>
